WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.920
What do the two numbers in a fraction mean?

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:08.900
The bottom says how many equal parts the whole is cut into.

00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.800
The top says how many parts you have.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:16.310
Three fifths: 5 parts, 3 taken.

00:00:16.310 --> 00:00:21.013
So three fifths means 3 of 5 equal parts.
